  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I tend to leave VCC running as I pop around between projects and I'd like to be able to simply be notified of an update without needing to restart it. Currently a restart seems to be needed to be notified for an update.\nNoted as 0.3.7 because that's the version number I was on when I noticed this issue before updating to the latest 1.0.0 version of VCC.",
